                                <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Oil-Based</p>
                                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm m-0">High VOC content contributes to smog. Many formulations are restricted or banned in California, the Northeast, and other high-regulation states. Not safe near waterways, stormwater drains, or gardens.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="p-5">
                                <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Water-Based</p>
                                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm m-0">Dramatically lower VOC emissions. Most water-based emulsions and acrylics are legal in all 50 states. Far safer for pets, children, and surrounding vegetation. Cleanup with water rather than solvents.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
